{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn9/","title":"내영향 EX-HN9","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 내영향의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"내영향 EX-HN9\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN9\n위치\n콧구멍 안에서 코연골과 코선반능선이 만나는 점막부위.\n취혈\n자침·주의\n三稜鍼으로 點刺出血하며, 出血이 잦은 사람은 禁忌한다.\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn9/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn9/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn9/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn9/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn9/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","last_reviewed":"2026-08-22"}
